/* 控件样式与副本列表页同源（小程序页面样式互相隔离，这里重复一份定义）；
   徽标继续用 app.wxss 的 .badge-L0…L3，不另创。 */

.hero {
  padding: 8rpx 4rpx 20rpx;
}

.hero-title {
  font-size: 38rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
}

.hero-en {
  font-size: 24rpx;
  margin-top: 4rpx;
}

.nameen {
  color: var(--blue);
}

.conflict {
  display: block;
  color: var(--warn);
  font-size: 22rpx;
  margin-top: 4rpx;
}

.hero-meta {
  margin-top: 14rpx;
}

.hero-build {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 8rpx;
  font-size: 22rpx;
}

.tag {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-right: 10rpx;
  padding: 2rpx 12rpx;
  border: 1rpx solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 8rpx;
  font-size: 22rpx;
  color: var(--txt-dim);
}

.todo {
  color: var(--lead);
  font-size: 20rpx;
  margin-left: 8rpx;
  border: 1rpx dashed var(--lead);
  border-radius: 8rpx;
  padding: 0 8rpx;
  vertical-align: middle;
}

.card-title {
  font-size: 28rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  margin-bottom: 12rpx;
}

.actions {
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.actions .btn {
  margin-right: 14rpx;
  background: transparent;
}



.btn-share {
  margin-right: 0;
  border-style: dashed;
}

.frow {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  padding: 14rpx 0;
  border-bottom: 1rpx solid var(--line);
}

.frow:last-child {
  border-bottom: 0;
}

.fkey {
  width: 168rpx;
  color: var(--txt-dim);
  font-size: 24rpx;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.fval {
  flex: 1;
  font-size: 26rpx;
}

.fnote {
  margin-top: 2rpx;
}

.route-note {
  margin-top: 12rpx;
  padding-top: 12rpx;
  border-top: 1rpx dashed var(--line);
}

.boss {
  padding: 14rpx 0;
  border-bottom: 1rpx solid var(--line);
}

.boss:last-child {
  border-bottom: 0;
}

.boss-main {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
}

.boss-name {
  font-size: 28rpx;
  margin-right: 10rpx;
}

.boss-badge {
  margin-left: auto;
}

.boss-note {
  margin-top: 4rpx;
  font-size: 22rpx;
}

.drop {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 12rpx 0;
  border-bottom: 1rpx solid var(--line);
}

.drop:last-child {
  border-bottom: 0;
}

.drop-main {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
}

.drop-name {
  font-size: 26rpx;
  display: block;
}

.drop-boss {
  font-size: 22rpx;
}

.drop-side {
  text-align: right;
  margin-left: 12rpx;
}

.drop-side .badge {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 4rpx;
}

.loot-note {
  margin-top: 14rpx;
  font-size: 22rpx;
}

.prov {
  background: var(--panel-2);
  border-radius: 10rpx;
  padding: 14rpx 16rpx;
  margin-bottom: 10rpx;
}

.prov-type {
  font-size: 22rpx;
  color: var(--ok);
}

.prov-note {
  font-size: 24rpx;
  margin: 4rpx 0;
}

.prov-url {
  word-break: break-all;
  font-size: 22rpx;
}


.bold {
  color: var(--txt);
}

.mono {
  font-family: Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
  font-size: 22rpx;
}

.gold {
  color: var(--gold);
}

.empty {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 40rpx 24rpx;
}

.empty .btn {
  display: inline-block;
  margin: 20rpx 0 0;
}

/* 素材位：图取不到时由 icon-cell 自己回落成自绘块，页面这边只管留位置与说明 */
.hero-art {
  margin-bottom: 16rpx;
}

.art-note {
  font-size: 20rpx;
  color: var(--txt-hint);
  margin-top: 8rpx;
}

.boss {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
}

.boss-face {
  width: 88rpx;
  margin-right: 16rpx;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.face-none {
  width: 88rpx;
  height: 88rpx;
  border: 1rpx dashed var(--line-2);
  border-radius: 2rpx;
  color: var(--txt-hint);
  font-size: 18rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  text-align: center;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.drop-face {
  margin-right: 14rpx;
}
